 prices cross $360 per tonne: IREF]]></title><description><![CDATA[India's expanding ethanol-blending programme has increased demand for grain-based feedstocks, including broken rice, maize and surplus rice supplied by the FCI]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://www.thehindubusinessline.com/economy/agri-business/india-may-reimpose-broken-rice-export-restrictions-as-prices-cross-360-per-tonne-iref/article71660565.ece]]></link><guid isPermaLink="false">article-71660565</guid><category><![CDATA[Agri Business]]></category><pubDate><![CDATA[Tue, 03 Nov 2026 17:53:16 +0530]]></pubDate><media:content height="675" medium="image" url="https://bl-i.thgim.com/public/incoming/ekvnmy/article67418264.ece/alternates/LANDSCAPE_1200/paraboiled%20rice.jpg" width="1200"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Natural rubber prices touch all-time high of ₹300 per kg]]></title><description><![CDATA[Traders say the early-season price rally relieves rubber farmers and could spur tapping, especially on untapped trees]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://www.thehindubusinessline.com/economy/agri-business/natural-rubber-prices-touch-all-time-high-of-300-per-kg/article71660468.ece]]></link><guid isPermaLink="false">article-71660468</guid><category><![CDATA[Agri Business]]></category><pubDate><![CDATA[Tue, 03 Nov 2026 17:43:41 +0530]]></pubDate><media:content height="675" medium="image" url="https://bl-i.thgim.com/public/incoming/kz67tv/article71660655.ece/alternates/LANDSCAPE_1200/03tvnearby1_G0JGN3GOFSIM.3.jpg.jpg" width="1200"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Hit by feed costs, poultry industry seeks duty-free maize imports]]></title><description><![CDATA[Breeders agree to work on a 110 a kg baseline price for live chicken]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://www.thehindubusinessline.com/economy/agri-business/hit-by-feed-costs-poultry-industry-seeks-duty-free-maize-imports/article71660457.ece]]></link><guid isPermaLink="false">article-71660457</guid><category><![CDATA[Agri Business]]></category><